  "title": "Fennec Shand Recovers from Her Injuries",
  "description": "Back out on the desert dunes, Fennec Shand awakens, and Boba Fett cracks open a black melon, giving it to her to drink. Shand is startled to see the modifications that have been done to her, but is ultimately thankful for what Fett has done. Boba recognizes her and tells her as much. Shand responds with the most natural query: \"Who are you?\" she asks. \"l am Boba Fett,\" he replies. Shand doubts his declaration, but his tale is enough to convince her."
